# P02 reproduction

Analytic claims are proved in main.tex. The portfolio REPRODUCTION_ENVELOPE.json records the unchanged canonical runner, pinned environment, exact command, canonical input hashes, per-stage logs and fresh output hashes. All 21 requested stages completed successfully, including historical suites; counts are not combined with the separate Paper B implementation suite.

Relevant outputs: runs/canonical_01/independent/oracle_contract_check.json and capability/data/{new_algorithm_checks.json,new_phase_fourier.json,unique_sat_reproduction.csv,small_simon.json,description_readout_ablation.json}. The phase table is generated by complete_p02.py from the fresh rank file; TABLE_PROVENANCE.json records its input hash. No randomness is introduced by the table generator.

The reproduction bundle preserves code, input copies, commands and results without including the virtual environment, local research database or credentials. The environment can be reconstructed from the pinned package list. Builds use pdflatex, bibtex, pdflatex twice with shell escape and package installation disabled. BUILD_MANIFEST.json records commands and final hashes.
